{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794550313320,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","part":{"partID":"prt_1d388ab62002nuyRLc1Lp9GDFX","sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","messageID":"msg_1d3889c38001pCK4sO2keKdtJN","type":"tool","id":"call_322480fe74784f158d4fb451","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG","path":".skilled","limit":60},"output":"Found 26 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs:\n  Line 300: // Gate verbose error/path logging behind SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG.\n\n  Line 303:   if (process.env.SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG === '1') {\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.1.md:\n  Line 294: - **If you run the skill advisor from a built copy:** run `npm run build` in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime` once. If you match on an advisor command id: `memory:save` and `command-memory-save` are now `command-speckit-save`. `command-spec-kit` is replaced by one id per command, such as `command-spec-kit-plan`. `command-prompt-improver` is now `command-prompt-improve`. To see hook health in `/doctor:setup`, run the hook once with `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1`. On Codex, approve the hook in `/hooks` so the brief arrives.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/phrase-variants.json:\n  Line 71452:       \"MK_SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\"\n\n  Line 71455:       \"MK_SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG gate\"\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md:\n  Line 191: | Diagnostics | Each hook record carries `runtime` (the Codex, Cursor and Devin adapters set `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` and Pi passes `pi`) plus `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. Records are written only with `SK