S\n KQ1: read the diagnostics writer and the `advisor_status` reader, then measure one debug-on record's bytes and the latency it adds to a hook invocation.\n \n","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-3/deep-research-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\\n## 9b. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n- none yet\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\",\"oldString\":\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-3/deep-research-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551096048,"end":1794551097238}}}}
