{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551867499,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","part":{"partID":"prt_1d3a06500002KPQdX6YJcrrxdQ","sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","messageID":"msg_1d3a03a8a001ErudKvJvsRH4RE","type":"tool","id":"call_0f4e6cdf928741d5a5049f34","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\nL=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-3\nsed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/ANCHOR:answered/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\" | head -10; echo \"=== dashboard status ===\"; grep -E \"^- Status:|^- Iteration:|Stop reason|Converged\" \"$L/deep-research-dashboard.md\" | head -6"},"output":"<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] KQ1: What should the hook-health default be, and what does a default-on record cost per prompt in bytes written, latency, file growth and privacy of what is recorded?\n- [x] KQ2: What do the brief and the cold path cost per prompt at HEAD, and which brief bytes can be cut with the same command, policy and skill still reaching the model?\n- [x] KQ3: Which ranked changes follow from the answers, by expected gain per unit of risk to the floors (typed recall 24 of 44, false offers 0 of 35, scorer [160,50,21,5])?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n=== dashboard status ===\n- Status: COMPLETE\n- Iteration: 5 of 6\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] KQ1: What should the hook-health default be, and what does a default-on record cost per prompt in bytes written, latency, file growth and privacy of what is recorded?\n- [x] KQ2: What do the brief and the cold path cost per prompt at HEAD, and which brief bytes can be cut with the same command, policy and skill still reaching the model?\n- [x] KQ3: Which ranked changes follow from the answers, by expected gain per unit of risk to the floors (typed recall 24 of 44, false offers 0 of 35, scorer [160,50,21,5])?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n=== dashboard status ===\n- Status: COMPLETE\n- Iteration: 5 of 6\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\\nL=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-3\\nsed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/ANCHOR:answered/p' \\\"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\\\" | head -10; echo \\\"=== dashboard status ===\\\"; grep -E \\\"^- Status:|^- Iteration:|Stop reason|Converged\\\" \\\"$L/deep-research-dashboard.md\\\" | head -6\"}"},"time":{"start":1794551866624,"end":1794551867499}}}}
