{"type":"text","timestamp":1794551883072,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","part":{"id":"prt_1d3a0945d002b8JpbqE6Ze38PJ","sessionID":"ses_e2c799db8ffeuOxKeAZwQ1KPTs","messageID":"msg_1d3a070e8001HtsS1GnWpa1Pj2","type":"text","text":"The lineage is complete and verified on disk: 5 iterations, 5 deltas, a synthesis, all recorded through the append gateway (sequences 1-7, exit 0, projection refreshed each time) with the reducer run after every iteration (dashboard COMPLETE, 0 corruptions, all 3 key questions ticked).\n\n**What the lane found**\n\n- **(c) Hook health default:** default a **health-only** diagnostic record on (status, freshness, durationMs, cacheHit) and keep `skillLabel`/`errorDetails` behind `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`. Measured cost: 196-202 B full record vs ~120 B health-only, 0.26 ms append (paired hook delta -4.69 ms, i.e. noise), bounded at 200 records/40 KB, 0600 in 0700. Today only 17 of 136 workspace metric keys have any diagnostic, so 86% can never show health. The reader needs only four fields; the record's skill id is the entire privacy cost.\n- **(f) Brief cost:** the live brief is **296 B (74 tokens) on a session's first prompt and 78 B (20 tokens) after it** — 44/44 rows carry command and policy. No information-free cut exists: the head is six load-bearing fields, and the 218-byte constant block is once per session. The started command document (median ~1,131 tokens) dominates.\n- **Measurement defect:** `measure-brief-cost.mjs` now reports **361 B** because its fresh socket can't reach the live daemon and every row becomes the `Advisor: outage (fail_open)` line — a 22% error, proven by a same-row A/B (361 sandboxed, 286-308 live).\n- **Ranked:** (1) health-only default record — 4 of 6 runtimes, doctor still needs a running daemon; (2) make the cost script refuse a degraded arm and report head bytes; (3) add `hookHealth.lastRecordAt` (strict-schema, rebuild-coupled). No brief cut, directive trim or embedder warm-up recommended; floors re-captured unchanged at 24/44 and 0/35.\n- **Gap:** cold-embedder sample unavailable (model loaded, no ollama control allowed); warm 7.89 ms median.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:ux-cost-3","time":{"start":1794551878749,"end":1794551883072}}}
